<b>Field Guide to Life
in Konakidani</b>

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:03.210
<b>Field Guide to Life
in Konakidani</b>

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:03.330
<b>Field Guide to Life
in Konakidani</b>

